OL,3,GNEWSACity becomes first to ban fast
OL,4,Afashion adverts
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol has become the first city in
OL,7,Fthe country to ban fast fashion adverts
OL,8,Fon council-owned billboards.
OL,10,FCouncillors voted in favour of
OL,11,Fproposals that will also prevent the
OL,12,Fadvertising of non-electric cars,
OL,13,Fflights, cruise holidays and travel
OL,14,Fagents.
OL,16,FThe ban will apply to all bus stops in
OL,17,Fthe city, and some free-standing
OL,18,Fscreens in the city centre. The council
OL,19,Fcan only choose who advertises in cases
OL,20,Fwhere it owns the display.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
