OL,3,GNEWSACity becomes first to ban fast
OL,4,Afashion adverts
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy council leader Heather Mack said
OL,7,Fshe was "thrilled that this green
OL,8,Fpolitical priority is being fulfilled."
